        <div class="container col-lg-9 col-sm-12 body-container color-overlay">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-12">
                    <div class="general-content">
                                                    <div class="body"><h3><strong>Fee Guides and Schedules</strong></h3>
<ul class="list list-square">
    <li>The <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.securities-administrators.ca/national-systems/feeguide/" target="_blank">SEDAR+ Regulatory Fee Guide</a> is a web-based application on the CSA website&nbsp;that, based on entered filing information, identifies the relevant regulatory filing fees governed by the provincial and territorial securities regulatory authorities. </li>
    <li>A complete and current Alberta fee schedule can be found in <a href="/securities-law-and-policy/regulatory-instruments/13-501">ASC Rule 13-501 <em>Fees</em></a>.</li>
    <li>For fees related to applications to the ASC please see <a href="/securities-law-and-policy/regulatory-instruments/12-601">ASC Policy 12-601</a>, Appendix 1.</li>
</ul>
<p>Calculate the regulatory and late fees for Form 45-106F1 <em>Report of Exempt Distribution</em> filings in Alberta <a href="/en/Online-Forms/Fee-Calculator" target="_blank">using our online fee calculator</a>.&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Contact Us</strong></p>
<ul class="list list-square">
    <li>For additional information relating to the Alberta fee schedule, please email <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#254446464a504b51560b574046404c5344474940654456460b4644"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="600103030f150e14134e12050305091601020c05200113034e0301">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>.</li>
    <li>For questions about a SEDI late insider fee, please email <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#0d7e68696c7f7d61787e4d6c7e6e236e6c"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="f38096979281839f8680b3928090dd9092">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>.</li>
</ul>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<hr />
<h3>Annual and Interim Continuous Disclosure Filing Deadlines</h3>
<p>The following annual and interim continuous disclosure filing deadlines apply to issuers required to file periodic disclosure under <a href="/securities-law-and-policy/regulatory-instruments/51-102">National Instrument 51-102 <em>Continuous Disclosure Obligations</em></a> and <a href="/securities-law-and-policy/regulatory-instruments/81-106">National Instrument 81-106 <em>Investment Fund Continuous Disclosure</em></a>.</p>
<ul class="list list-square">
    <li><strong>Interim filing deadlines</strong> relate to interim financial statements and MD&amp;A/MRFP</li>
    <li><strong>Annual filing deadlines</strong> relate to annual financial statements, MD&amp;A/MRFP and AIF</li>
</ul>
<table cellpadding="50">
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td><strong>Period Ending<br />
            (Interim or Annual)&nbsp;</strong></td>
            <td colspan="2"><strong>Non-Venture Issuer Deadlines&nbsp;</strong></td>
            <td colspan="2"><strong>Venture Issuer Deadlines&nbsp;</strong></td>
            <td colspan="2"><strong>Investment Fund Issuer Deadlines</strong>&nbsp;</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
